        "test_procedure": "1. Create empty trie, record initial state of _data.\n2. Call trie_set(trie, non_existent_key, trie.default).\n3. Verify _data is unchanged (no new entries, no modifications).\n4. Verify trie root is unchanged.\n5. Test with various key types and default value types.",
        "bug_class": "State Consistency",
        "risk_category": "Tampering",
        "notes": "Source: PROP-0019, Invariant: INV-006. Spurious insertion on delete = trie corruption.",
        "code_scope": {
